# net xyz-z-actual-position-rt  lcec.0.<slave_z>.position-actual-value      => xyz-z-actual-position

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPERATIONAL RULES
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# - one adapter instance per axis
# - one backend slave or backend instance per axis
# - do NOT share transport pins between axes
# - do NOT share controlword paths between axes
# - do NOT bypass mux/cw
# - semantic ownership remains per axis
#
# FRAMEWORK AUTHORITY PER AXIS MUST REMAIN:
#   cw_<axis>  -> adapter_<axis>.in-controlword
#   mux_<axis> -> adapter_<axis>.in-opmode
#   mux_<axis> -> adapter_<axis>.in-target-position
#
# FEEDBACK RETURN PATH PER AXIS MUST REMAIN:
#   adapter_<axis>.out-statusword
#   adapter_<axis>.out-opmode-display
#   adapter_<axis>.out-actual-position
#
# END OF FILE
